      "message": "In the VAT breakdown at {.} the taxable amount (BT-116) is {/BT-116} at the rate (BT-119) of {/BT-119} per cent, which comes to {$computed}, and the VAT category tax amount (BT-117) carries {/BT-117}, exactly one unit of the invoice currency away; the official UBL artefact of release 1.3.16 faults that difference and the CII artefact admits it."
