    "source": "EN 16931-1, 6.4.2, Table 4, BR-CO-19",
    "note": "The rule is implemented and cannot fail on a document that passed layer L1. A business group of an ESJ document exists exactly when it carries a value, and the group this rule is about carries no business term other than the two it asks for; a group with neither of them is not an empty group but no group at all. The XML binding can write the empty element the rule was written for, so the rule earns its place in a pack that also serves documents imported from XML — but it earns it as a statement, not as a check that can speak here."
  },
